OL,3,GNEWSA'Heartbreaking': The man set to
OL,4,Alose his home due to the UK's #5bn
OL,5,Atheme park
OL,6,
OL,7,FSurrounded by rolling fields and lakes,
OL,8,FRitchie Wood's home of 11 years
OL,9,Fprovided the serene village life he
OL,10,Floved.
OL,12,FYet in recent weeks, his neighbours
OL,13,Fhave packed their bags and left - their
OL,14,Fhouses in Kempston Hardwick,
OL,15,FBedfordshire, soon to be reduced to
OL,16,Frubble.
OL,18,F"It's totally changed to how it used to
OL,19,Fbe - it used to be lovely. We had a
OL,20,Fnice little community here, lots of
OL,21,Fwildlife, very quiet," Wood tells the
OL,22,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
